If the djinni was going to give you a wish, he would have given it to
already.  Since he is thanking you, it would appear that what you have
is a tame djinni.  They're rather buff as pets go, but I'd rather have
a wish.  Ordinarily, I would recommend waiting until you are Fainting
from hunger and then #praying, but that's not likely to work since
your god is upset with you.  If you don't find food before then, I
would recommend quitting and starting over.  For future reference,
it's no coincidence that monster corpses use the same character as
food items.  Some monsers are good to eat, some not so good.  Don't
eat one that's very old, though, as you may acquire some incurable
disease.

